
---

# .gitignore

Create `.gitignore` in root folder:

```gitignore
# Simulation files
*.vcd
*.vvp
*.out
systolic_sim

# Vivado generated files
*.xpr
*.jou
*.log
*.str

.cache/
.hw/
.ip_user_files/
.runs/
.sim/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Temporary files
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# OS files
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini